'''Bulbasaur''' (Japanese: '''フシギダネ''' ''Fushigidane'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

