==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Bulbasaur|77}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Bulbasaur}}.
*{{m|Vine Whip}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Bulbasaur}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

